actions.command:
cat > diagnosis.json << 'EOF'
{"spec_element": "invariant", "proof_obligation": "preservation", "diagnosis": "The invariant on line 59 uses 'bi < (|b|) - 1' instead of 'bi < |b|'. This makes the invariant too weak: when bi == |b| - 1 (the last element of b), we cannot conclude output[|output|-1] <= b[bi]. The loop body appends b[bi] to output, and the sortedness invariant (line 60) requires the last element of the old output to be <= the newly appended element. Without the guarantee from line 59 when bi == |b| - 1, preservation of the sortedness invariant fails."}
EOF
